WEBVTT

00:55.054 --> 00:56.556
KWON MAN-SU'S ELECTION CAMPAIGN

00:59.934 --> 01:01.227
Listen up, residents of Seongjin City!

01:02.270 --> 01:04.814
Don't vote for candidate number one,
Kwon Man-su!

01:04.898 --> 01:07.776
He's a complete hypocrite,
and he discriminates people!

01:10.403 --> 01:11.321
Watch out for the bang!

01:14.199 --> 01:17.619
Look at me, look at me

01:17.702 --> 01:21.039
Look at me

01:34.260 --> 01:36.471
He's having so much fun.

01:38.223 --> 01:39.057
Don't you agree?

01:41.059 --> 01:42.018
Should I just

01:44.437 --> 01:45.396
have fun with you?

01:50.944 --> 01:51.778
Should I do that?

01:59.494 --> 02:03.081
A man in his 20s suddenly showed up naked
in front of Seongjin City Hall

02:03.373 --> 02:06.668
where an election campaign was being held
and caused a big commotion.

02:06.793 --> 02:09.379
But this young man turned out to be

02:09.462 --> 02:12.715
Assemblyman Kwon Man-su's second son.

02:12.799 --> 02:14.384
Thus, the incident will most likely
inflict a heavy blow

02:14.467 --> 02:16.386
on the general election
which is a week away.

02:16.469 --> 02:17.720
MR. KWON
SON OF ASSEMBLYMAN KWON

02:17.804 --> 02:19.389
He locked me up for causing trouble.

02:20.306 --> 02:22.684
He committed child abuse
and violated his human rights!

02:22.767 --> 02:24.477
Kwon Man-su should resign his candidacy!

02:24.561 --> 02:27.647
- Resign! Resign!
- After the recent incident,

02:27.730 --> 02:30.733
many people including a few civic groups
have been requesting him

02:30.817 --> 02:34.195
- to resign his candidacy.
- That man will have to resign.

02:34.279 --> 02:37.240
- The integrity of the home is essential...
- What are you going to do about Ms. Ko?

02:37.323 --> 02:39.367
- How can a cruel father like him
- She caused this to happen.

02:39.450 --> 02:42.453
- take care of other people's families
- I don't know. What should we do?

02:42.537 --> 02:43.913
and work for the country?

02:44.956 --> 02:46.958
He should resign his candidacy.

02:52.422 --> 02:57.677
CHAPTER 4 ZOMBIE KID

02:57.802 --> 03:01.139
Look at me

03:01.222 --> 03:04.142
- Someone take the microphone away!
- Candidate number one

03:04.225 --> 03:05.643
3 HOURS AGO

03:06.561 --> 03:09.147
- Hurry!
- My goodness.

03:09.439 --> 03:10.773
- Look at him.
- My gosh.

03:11.274 --> 03:12.191
What should we do?

03:15.153 --> 03:16.821
Where are you going?
You said you wanted to have fun.

03:16.905 --> 03:17.822
When did I say that?

03:18.907 --> 03:20.199
Are you a mythomaniac?

03:22.035 --> 03:23.411
What I said earlier...

03:24.996 --> 03:26.205
I was just talking to myself.

03:27.540 --> 03:29.167
Compliment me for doing the right thing.

03:29.250 --> 03:30.877
- And what exactly is that?
- Kidnapping him.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.922
You didn't stop him earlier.
You just let him be.

03:34.005 --> 03:35.465
That's because I did the right thing.

03:36.758 --> 03:37.592
Am I wrong?

03:38.176 --> 03:39.385
Then why didn't you stop him?

03:43.097 --> 03:44.807
How could I stop him
from dancing and singing

03:45.391 --> 03:46.434
when he's so good at it?

03:51.314 --> 03:52.315
Hey!

03:55.693 --> 03:57.737
Who are you people?
Are you from the hospital?

03:57.820 --> 04:00.531
No, I'm a writer. And he's my safety pin.

04:02.033 --> 04:05.787
If anything happens to Assemblyman Kwon
because of what happened today...

04:05.870 --> 04:06.829
Yes?

04:08.623 --> 04:10.041
You'd better brace yourselves.

04:11.084 --> 04:13.086
My goodness, really? You're so scary.

04:13.169 --> 04:15.463
- I'm so frightened. What am I going to do?
- You little...

04:18.341 --> 04:19.550
Watch yourself.

04:22.387 --> 04:25.139
Both of you just crossed the line.

04:25.723 --> 04:26.599
Brace yourselves.

04:29.852 --> 04:32.188
Why does that idiot keep telling us
to brace ourselves?

04:40.154 --> 04:42.407
Gang-tae, Gi-do wishes to talk to you.

04:45.952 --> 04:47.161
I see you're working very hard.

04:51.541 --> 04:52.959
Wait here. Don't go anywhere.

04:57.880 --> 04:59.090
Let's go.

04:59.257 --> 05:02.176
Anyway, thank you for helping us
despite your busy schedule.

05:07.348 --> 05:08.182
Gang-tae.

05:10.852 --> 05:12.603
All my wishes came true today.

05:15.773 --> 05:17.483
Today was the best day of my life.

05:18.234 --> 05:21.863
So don't get angry at her
for driving me here.

05:24.657 --> 05:25.491
Okay?

05:32.457 --> 05:33.833
- Mom, he'll be fine.
- Good gracious.

05:33.916 --> 05:35.293
- Mom.
- He'll be okay.

05:35.960 --> 05:39.797
I'm sorry, but we need a family member
to come with us to the hospital.

05:39.881 --> 05:41.257
Are you crazy?

05:41.632 --> 05:43.634
Why would we go to a psychiatric hospital?

05:45.219 --> 05:48.347
Go ahead with your father.
I'll catch up with you later.

05:49.015 --> 05:49.932
Mom.

05:51.559 --> 05:52.643
Mom!

05:55.104 --> 05:56.105
Gi-do.

05:58.858 --> 06:00.318
Mom, I feel a lot better...

06:02.403 --> 06:05.865
Are you happy now that you've humiliated
our entire family?

06:06.741 --> 06:10.244
Are you satisfied
now that you've disgraced your father

06:11.329 --> 06:12.955
who you have hated for all those years?

06:14.332 --> 06:15.625
Mom, I just--

06:15.917 --> 06:18.628
Why did you have to be born so dumb

06:20.129 --> 06:23.132
and get treated that way?

06:23.925 --> 06:25.843
Why do you always act out

06:26.052 --> 06:28.221
only to make my heart ache so much?

06:28.304 --> 06:30.598
Why couldn't you just stay quiet?

06:30.681 --> 06:32.767
Why did you have to cross the line

06:33.351 --> 06:36.938
and cause such a big a fuss, you fool?

06:38.147 --> 06:39.315
Why?

07:06.968 --> 07:08.511
My mom knows how to slap really hard.

07:12.557 --> 07:14.183
She never cared about me

07:14.267 --> 07:16.602
because she was always busy
taking care of my other siblings.

07:21.315 --> 07:23.526
But I just realized something
after I got slapped by her.

07:24.652 --> 07:25.653
Gang-tae.

07:27.655 --> 07:29.365
My mom doesn't hate me.

07:30.283 --> 07:31.617
She loves me like crazy.

07:34.745 --> 07:35.872
How do you know?

07:37.165 --> 07:38.875
You can tell
when you're the one getting hit.

07:40.501 --> 07:43.421
For some reason, when someone
hits you with affection it strangely...

07:44.881 --> 07:46.632
doesn't make you feel upset.

07:51.429 --> 07:52.555
Gang-tae!

07:54.223 --> 07:57.143
Why did you do that?
Why did you send your brother home first?

07:57.226 --> 07:59.562
You should've stayed with him all day!

08:00.605 --> 08:02.523
What were you doing
when he was getting beaten up?

08:02.982 --> 08:05.485
I let you learn martial arts
so you could protect your brother.

08:05.568 --> 08:07.487
How could you let him come home
looking like that?

08:09.697 --> 08:10.531
Are you serious?

08:11.657 --> 08:13.534
My gosh, it's pouring.

08:16.496 --> 08:18.456
You'll catch a cold. Are you okay?

08:32.220 --> 08:33.304
You see, honey,

08:34.680 --> 08:36.516
I won't die early like you did.

08:38.434 --> 08:40.520
I'm going to live a long life.

08:41.979 --> 08:45.691
I'm going to watch Sang-tae
grow old and die.

08:47.109 --> 08:50.029
And then, I'll die the next day.

09:01.082 --> 09:01.916
Mom?

09:05.461 --> 09:08.589
My goodness, did you wake up?

09:14.637 --> 09:16.639
- Gang-tae.
- Yes?

09:17.223 --> 09:19.892
You need to stay by your brother's side
until the day you die.

09:23.312 --> 09:25.439
I'll raise him.

09:26.315 --> 09:29.694
Your job is to look after your brother
and keep him safe.

09:30.444 --> 09:31.404
Okay?

09:38.077 --> 09:39.453
That's why

09:41.122 --> 09:43.165
I gave birth to you.

10:00.641 --> 10:01.851
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

10:06.897 --> 10:08.274
We should go, too.

10:11.444 --> 10:12.278
Ju-ri.

10:17.950 --> 10:20.536
- We should also get going.
- Are we going to have fun?

10:21.412 --> 10:22.580
We're going to the hospital.

10:23.497 --> 10:24.749
Don't speed.

10:41.098 --> 10:43.392
Ju-ri. You can go without me.

10:44.226 --> 10:45.811
I'll go with her.

10:51.108 --> 10:51.942
Why?

10:52.818 --> 10:53.694
It's just that...

10:58.324 --> 10:59.784
I don't think she should drive alone.

11:19.053 --> 11:20.388
If you didn't get in my car,

11:22.014 --> 11:23.682
I was going to kidnap you.

11:25.810 --> 11:27.269
Is that your hobby?

11:27.978 --> 11:30.481
I know you were jealous of him
when he was having a blast.

11:31.565 --> 11:35.069
"I want to put everything down
and have fun just like him."

11:35.945 --> 11:37.613
I could tell from the look on your face.

11:39.657 --> 11:40.991
Let me know when you're ready.

11:41.409 --> 11:44.203
I'll kidnap you
and let you have the time of your life.

11:44.286 --> 11:45.871
It will be magnificent.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.877
Forget it.

11:53.045 --> 11:56.090
Okay, fine.
When it looks like you want to run away,

11:56.924 --> 11:59.135
I'll run away with you
right there and then.

11:59.969 --> 12:01.011
Look forward to it.

12:29.039 --> 12:30.082
Damn.

12:30.166 --> 12:33.544
I hate flowers that fall petal by petal.

12:40.801 --> 12:42.178
I like magnolias.

12:42.761 --> 12:45.014
The whole flower falls at once
without hesitation.

12:45.097 --> 12:46.265
I like that about them.

12:50.144 --> 12:52.771
You really have a way of comparing things.

12:52.855 --> 12:54.565
Beautiful comparison, isn't it?

12:59.111 --> 13:01.655
Yes, magnolias sound like
the perfect flower for you.

13:02.239 --> 13:03.741
What's your favorite flower?

13:06.494 --> 13:07.453
I don't like them.

13:09.622 --> 13:11.207
I don't like it when spring comes.

13:12.791 --> 13:13.626
Why not?

13:16.879 --> 13:20.299
Because that's when I need to leave again.

13:22.051 --> 13:22.885
What?

14:05.928 --> 14:07.263
Mr. Lee.

14:07.346 --> 14:08.847
Yes, how did it go?

14:09.598 --> 14:12.226
The injunction that was filed
against Zombie Kid

14:12.309 --> 14:13.602
got approved, sir.

14:16.730 --> 14:18.607
Oh, I see.

14:19.858 --> 14:23.654
Okay then. I guess we'll just
have to return everything. Right?

14:23.779 --> 14:24.613
Yes.

14:25.614 --> 14:26.448
Is this funny to you?

14:27.157 --> 14:28.742
How could you be smiling?

14:29.243 --> 14:31.495
The company is about to go bankrupt,
and you're smiling?

14:33.038 --> 14:35.457
Then should I cry?

14:35.541 --> 14:36.458
No.

14:37.459 --> 14:38.294
Just leave.

14:38.878 --> 14:41.046
Just write a resignation letter and leave.

14:55.561 --> 14:56.395
I have

14:57.354 --> 15:00.149
finally found my red shoes.

15:09.241 --> 15:10.326
INFORMATION ON MOON GANG-TAE

15:15.497 --> 15:17.124
Mr. Lee, would you like some coffee?

15:18.000 --> 15:19.126
Where are you going?

15:20.210 --> 15:21.337
I'm going on a business trip.

15:22.588 --> 15:23.714
Bye, sir.

15:29.261 --> 15:30.095
Nice.

15:41.774 --> 15:44.068
You wanted to eat,
and this is what you're buying me?

15:44.151 --> 15:45.569
I'm in a hurry. My shift starts soon.

15:47.029 --> 15:49.281
- Do you want a rice ball?
- Forget it.

15:54.787 --> 15:55.788
Hello?

15:57.539 --> 15:58.374
Just a second.

15:59.792 --> 16:00.709
Go ahead and eat.

16:07.508 --> 16:09.927
Darn, he didn't even buy any kimchi.

16:10.010 --> 16:11.553
He really doesn't spend money.

16:12.096 --> 16:13.889
I don't care if he's poor,
but I hate scrooges.

16:13.973 --> 16:15.265
What brings you to call me?

16:15.391 --> 16:17.393
Is everything okay?

16:17.476 --> 16:18.310
What?

16:19.395 --> 16:20.479
I'm relieved.

16:22.481 --> 16:23.357
What is he saying?

16:25.317 --> 16:26.276
Darn it.

16:26.360 --> 16:28.904
Mr. Moon, let me ask you something.

16:28.988 --> 16:31.865
Did Mun-yeong ever happen to tell you

16:32.241 --> 16:36.662
that you're pretty
and that she wants to have you?

16:38.247 --> 16:40.165
- Why me?
- Because I can't stop wanting you.

16:40.666 --> 16:42.668
- But why?
- Because you're so pretty.

16:46.171 --> 16:47.631
I guess she did. I'm sure of it.

16:48.799 --> 16:49.758
What if she did?

16:50.426 --> 16:52.928
Okay, listen to me carefully.

16:53.012 --> 16:55.180
When she says she wants something,

16:55.264 --> 16:57.641
she practically means she's hungry for it.

16:58.434 --> 17:02.855
So in other words,
she's saying she's going to eat you alive.

17:06.483 --> 17:07.609
What's your point?

17:07.693 --> 17:12.114
My point is that you and I are both
in a state of emergency.

17:12.489 --> 17:14.950
Her new book got banned from being sold,

17:15.034 --> 17:18.370
so she can't afford to be
spending time with you right now.

17:18.454 --> 17:20.039
She needs to start writing her next book.

17:23.751 --> 17:24.918
His shoulders are so broad.

17:29.798 --> 17:32.926
Anyway, I'll go there
and do everything I can to take her back.

17:33.010 --> 17:35.471
So please stay alive... I mean...

17:36.055 --> 17:38.390
Please hang in there until then.

17:39.308 --> 17:40.517
Good luck.

17:52.654 --> 17:53.655
Who was it?

17:55.282 --> 17:57.159
- The hospital.
- Did they tell you to hurry?

17:58.118 --> 17:59.286
Are they going to fire me?

18:01.497 --> 18:03.457
You're very good at ignoring people.

18:03.832 --> 18:04.833
Good for you.

18:10.255 --> 18:11.298
I heard your new book

18:13.050 --> 18:14.218
got banned from being sold.

18:14.968 --> 18:15.969
Zombie Kid?

18:18.263 --> 18:20.724
Is it because of what you did last time
for my brother?

18:20.891 --> 18:24.103
They wouldn't do that just because
I cursed and pulled at a man's hair.

18:24.478 --> 18:26.772
They think the illustration and storyline
are too grotesque.

18:27.231 --> 18:30.901
Those idiots can't read the actual message
that's hidden behind the letters.

18:30.984 --> 18:31.944
Darn them.

18:35.197 --> 18:36.323
What's the message?

18:38.325 --> 18:40.619
You should read it.
I want to hear what you think about it.

18:41.203 --> 18:42.579
I'm too old for fairy tales.

18:42.996 --> 18:45.124
Oh, come on.
I think you're just the right age for it.

18:48.085 --> 18:49.086
How old are you?

18:50.295 --> 18:51.130
Me?

18:52.840 --> 18:54.842
I'm just a little kid.

18:56.927 --> 19:00.264
But you're more like a kid than I am.

19:02.099 --> 19:03.392
Why am I like a kid?

19:09.815 --> 19:11.650
Because I can see that

19:12.693 --> 19:13.694
you want to be loved.

20:02.451 --> 20:04.286
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

20:25.933 --> 20:26.934
Mom.

20:32.147 --> 20:34.358
UNDER SEDATION
DO NOT DISTURB

20:42.199 --> 20:44.368
About Assemblyman Kwon...

20:45.035 --> 20:46.745
Judging by his personality,

20:46.828 --> 20:49.289
he'll throw a fit
if he ends up having to resign.

20:49.873 --> 20:51.458
Shouldn't we do something about it?

20:51.541 --> 20:53.794
Get ready to get sued.

20:53.877 --> 20:54.795
Again?

20:57.339 --> 20:58.173
Oh, okay, sir.

20:59.258 --> 21:01.843
Why don't you fire Ms. Ko Mun-yeong?

21:02.219 --> 21:03.220
She kidnapped the patient.

21:03.303 --> 21:06.306
Let's be honest. She didn't kidnap him.

21:06.890 --> 21:09.059
He willingly got in her car.

21:09.434 --> 21:11.645
But still, we need to fire her.

21:11.728 --> 21:14.648
She never takes her father out for a walk.

21:14.731 --> 21:18.151
She told me she never promised
to do such a thing.

21:18.527 --> 21:19.361
Right, Ju-ri?

21:20.654 --> 21:21.530
Yes.

21:22.698 --> 21:24.199
You guys are acquainted, aren't you?

21:26.243 --> 21:27.077
Yes.

21:27.369 --> 21:28.912
What? Are you serious?

21:29.162 --> 21:31.373
- What? How?
- Since when?

21:31.456 --> 21:34.668
We knew each other for a while
when we were young.

21:34.751 --> 21:36.420
Then you guys are practically friends.

21:38.213 --> 21:41.425
What do you think
we should do about her, Ms. Nam?

21:43.010 --> 21:43.927
I think

21:45.470 --> 21:47.431
we should fire her.

21:47.514 --> 21:48.724
Ms. Ko

21:50.183 --> 21:51.935
doesn't belong here.

21:55.897 --> 21:57.441
What are you going to do, sir?

21:58.567 --> 22:00.986
We're not in a rush.

22:02.154 --> 22:04.281
So let's check the patient's condition
and then decide.

22:05.115 --> 22:05.949
Okay.

22:28.638 --> 22:29.598
Don't turn it on.

22:29.681 --> 22:31.183
I don't want to listen
to other people talking.

22:33.101 --> 22:35.896
I want to hear you talk.
Just go ahead and say anything.

22:38.356 --> 22:39.191
Well...

22:42.861 --> 22:44.446
Do you have nothing to say to me?

22:47.032 --> 22:50.118
Why don't you take
your father outside for walks?

22:50.202 --> 22:51.703
You promised the hospital director.

22:53.246 --> 22:54.122
"Promise"?

22:55.415 --> 22:57.375
That stuff is useless like trash.

22:57.959 --> 22:59.711
I got what I want,
so I don't need it anymore.

23:00.003 --> 23:01.421
He has dementia.

23:01.505 --> 23:04.382
His soul is dead.
His body is just an empty shell.

23:04.633 --> 23:06.510
Why would I waste my time
on something like that?

23:07.928 --> 23:10.097
It would be better if he just died.

23:12.849 --> 23:14.518
Why did your parents pass away?

23:17.521 --> 23:19.147
How do you know that?

23:19.981 --> 23:21.608
I did my research.

23:24.945 --> 23:27.072
It was just a simple background check.

23:27.155 --> 23:30.492
It's just like how we check the origin
and expiration date of the stuff we buy.

23:31.034 --> 23:32.994
So it's no big deal.

23:33.870 --> 23:34.704
"Stuff"?

23:35.914 --> 23:37.332
Are people like products to you?

23:37.415 --> 23:38.750
What's the difference?

23:39.292 --> 23:40.919
Children abandon their parents

23:41.002 --> 23:42.838
when their parents become old and feeble.

23:43.213 --> 23:45.757
Parents favor the child
that makes them happy

23:45.841 --> 23:47.676
and abandon the child
that's dumb and useless.

23:48.176 --> 23:50.303
Isn't that what happened to Teeny-weeny?

23:54.975 --> 23:55.809
Stop the car.

23:55.892 --> 23:57.310
What? Why?

23:57.894 --> 23:58.937
I said, stop the car.

23:59.521 --> 24:01.106
Why? Do you need to pee?

24:12.075 --> 24:13.493
What's with you all of a sudden?

24:13.577 --> 24:14.536
Why are you angry?

24:15.036 --> 24:16.329
Just tell me why.

24:17.539 --> 24:18.373
Hey!

24:20.083 --> 24:22.294
What are you so angry about?

24:25.005 --> 24:26.006
I...

24:27.757 --> 24:28.633
forgot.

24:29.718 --> 24:30.552
What?

24:31.261 --> 24:33.221
That you're different from others.

24:34.222 --> 24:35.223
I forgot that for a while.

24:39.769 --> 24:40.812
I must've unknowingly

24:42.647 --> 24:44.274
expected something from you.

24:46.109 --> 24:47.485
What did you expect from me?

24:52.532 --> 24:53.950
What is it that you expected?

24:57.370 --> 24:58.455
It's gone now.

25:03.335 --> 25:04.169
I love you.

25:15.680 --> 25:17.224
I love you, Gang-tae.

25:26.107 --> 25:26.942
I love you!

25:27.943 --> 25:28.860
I said, I love you!

25:29.361 --> 25:30.987
I love you so much!

25:32.864 --> 25:33.865
You're running away again?

25:33.949 --> 25:35.533
I said I love you! Why are you leaving?

25:35.617 --> 25:37.619
Why? I love you! Hey!

25:37.702 --> 25:39.996
I love you! I really love you! Hey!

26:04.229 --> 26:05.981
He's unbelievable.

26:06.439 --> 26:09.901
We were getting along just fine.
Why did he explode all of a sudden?

26:10.402 --> 26:12.112
Is he not right in his mind?

26:13.196 --> 26:15.532
What in the world made him angry?

26:22.789 --> 26:25.166
SEONGJIN VOCATIONAL SCHOOL

26:27.877 --> 26:29.129
Gosh, that was hard.

26:29.212 --> 26:31.506
Yes, I had a hard time.

26:31.923 --> 26:32.757
Sang-tae.

26:39.639 --> 26:40.890
What did you learn today?

26:41.683 --> 26:43.143
How to make jam.

26:43.643 --> 26:45.520
It sounds like fun. Strawberry jam?

26:46.021 --> 26:47.230
It was boring.

26:47.897 --> 26:50.233
I was bored to death.

26:54.904 --> 26:55.905
I'm sorry, Sang-tae.

26:56.406 --> 26:58.908
I couldn't find any schools
that teaches art in this neighborhood.

26:59.200 --> 27:01.036
- Instead, I'll--
- I'm going to draw on the wall.

27:01.119 --> 27:02.620
I'm going to draw on the hospital wall.

27:02.704 --> 27:05.123
I'll draw, make money,
sweep the garden, and find coins.

27:05.206 --> 27:07.334
That's what you call
"killing two birds with one stone."

27:08.668 --> 27:11.671
Then are you going to provide for me now?
I should quit and have fun.

27:11.755 --> 27:14.090
Don't... Don't worry. Just trust me.

27:14.174 --> 27:15.425
I'm your older brother.

27:15.508 --> 27:17.260
I'm the older brother,
so you can count on me.

27:18.595 --> 27:21.514
Then should we buy the necessary tools?

27:22.307 --> 27:26.061
- Is there an art supply store nearby?
- I'm your older brother, not your uncle.

27:47.123 --> 27:49.417
Gosh, this place is so gloomy.

27:50.043 --> 27:51.044
Why are you here?

27:51.336 --> 27:54.297
How could anyone
live in a house like this,

27:54.631 --> 27:56.883
let alone come up with ideas
to write anything?

27:58.218 --> 28:01.805
Mun-yeong, let's go back to Seoul.

28:02.764 --> 28:06.059
Go back to the luxurious hotel
and start writing your next book.

28:06.726 --> 28:09.312
It's only been a few days
since we said I disappeared.

28:09.896 --> 28:12.732
I forgot that you're not just a writer
but also a famous celebrity.

28:12.816 --> 28:15.777
If you don't show your face to the public,
they'll easily forget about you.

28:15.860 --> 28:17.779
You have no idea how quick
they forget things.

28:17.862 --> 28:19.364
Things just disappear from their heads.

28:19.447 --> 28:21.408
No, I don't want to go.
I'm going to have fun here.

28:21.491 --> 28:25.078
Mun-yeong, can't you have fun in Seoul?

28:25.161 --> 28:27.122
You... You shouldn't be here.

28:27.205 --> 28:30.208
You know why. This is where your mother...

28:35.130 --> 28:35.964
Then

28:38.425 --> 28:40.051
why don't you move in with me?

28:40.677 --> 28:41.511
What?

28:42.762 --> 28:45.974
My gosh, you seem very tired.

28:46.558 --> 28:49.144
You should get some good rest.
I'll call you again tomorrow.

28:49.227 --> 28:50.061
I'll be off now.

29:10.206 --> 29:12.292
That you're different from others.

29:12.375 --> 29:13.960
I forgot that for a while.

29:31.519 --> 29:33.021
You're different from others.

29:36.483 --> 29:37.734
You're extremely special.

29:43.406 --> 29:46.117
You're my greatest creation.

29:48.119 --> 29:49.454
You are my other self.

29:51.706 --> 29:53.208
I love you, my daughter.

30:50.974 --> 30:52.141
- Here's your pizza.
- Excuse me.

30:52.976 --> 30:54.727
- Yes?
- I read that you get a free caricature

30:54.811 --> 30:56.271
when you order a full-size pizza.

30:56.354 --> 30:59.440
Right, but it's only offered
during the daytime. I'm sorry.

30:59.524 --> 31:01.067
Gosh, I've been baited.

31:03.027 --> 31:04.028
I've totally been baited.

31:05.738 --> 31:09.284
What kind of bait can I use to persuade
Mun-yeong to go back to Seoul with me?

31:12.245 --> 31:13.079
Hey, Jae-su.

31:42.483 --> 31:43.651
I'll get some wings

31:44.611 --> 31:46.112
and a beer.

31:46.362 --> 31:49.115
What's gotten into you? You never drink.

31:49.198 --> 31:50.909
I'm just going to have one beer.

31:51.910 --> 31:54.704
What? Something must've happened
at the hospital today.

31:54.787 --> 31:55.663
No.

31:56.539 --> 31:59.751
Gosh, whatever. I'll drink with you.

31:59.834 --> 32:03.046
No, you should work. I'll just drink solo.

32:05.298 --> 32:06.132
All right, then.

32:08.760 --> 32:10.219
I'm here alone too.

32:14.265 --> 32:15.975
Would you like to join me?

32:16.726 --> 32:18.353
This pizza is way too big for one person.

32:20.104 --> 32:21.814
I see, but no thanks.

32:23.232 --> 32:24.317
Sorry about that.

32:41.709 --> 32:44.921
What do you think
we should do about her, Ms. Nam?

32:45.004 --> 32:46.005
I think

32:46.589 --> 32:48.216
we should fire her.

32:50.760 --> 32:53.471
Gosh. You're so petty, Nam Ju-ri.

32:55.098 --> 32:56.599
What can you do though?

32:58.768 --> 33:01.062
I have no choice but to suck up to her
to earn a living.

33:02.772 --> 33:04.691
Still, she shouldn't be here.

33:05.024 --> 33:06.109
She absolutely shouldn't.

33:06.901 --> 33:09.529
She shouldn't be there. Never.

33:10.697 --> 33:14.075
I'll take her back to Seoul with me
no matter what.

33:14.492 --> 33:15.326
I have to.

33:21.624 --> 33:22.792
Are they echoing each other?

33:25.169 --> 33:27.213
It sounds like
they're talking about the same thing.

33:31.384 --> 33:32.385
Put them in here.

33:33.886 --> 33:35.805
Size 8, 12...

33:39.642 --> 33:42.812
Where's size six? There it is.

33:42.895 --> 33:44.605
Size seven...

34:10.465 --> 34:12.425
I love you, Gang-tae.

34:13.134 --> 34:14.385
I love you!

34:14.594 --> 34:16.137
I said, I love you!

34:27.148 --> 34:29.150
- So pretty.
- Because you're so pretty.

34:31.694 --> 34:32.695
I want it.

34:32.779 --> 34:35.364
Moon Gang-tae, what I want is you.
Because I can't stop wanting you.

34:35.448 --> 34:37.075
When I see something pretty, I want it.

34:37.158 --> 34:38.367
And I need to have what I want.

34:41.120 --> 34:42.538
I want this.

34:42.622 --> 34:43.664
I'm getting this.

34:45.083 --> 34:48.169
Hello, I'm ready to pay.

34:48.252 --> 34:49.378
My gosh, so many!

34:50.421 --> 34:53.466
I'm taking all this.
Everything here except for the basket.

34:53.966 --> 34:55.301
I'm getting so many things.

35:01.474 --> 35:02.433
So many things.

35:05.353 --> 35:06.938
- So many things.
- What's the total?

35:07.021 --> 35:08.314
It's 53,000 won.

35:09.148 --> 35:09.982
So many things.

35:10.983 --> 35:12.151
Thank you.

35:12.443 --> 35:14.570
Pteranodon. They have...

35:14.904 --> 35:17.949
They have a throat sac
where they can store fish.

35:18.533 --> 35:22.537
Flight muscles... Because of the weak
flight muscles, they can't really fly...

35:22.620 --> 35:24.205
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

35:32.255 --> 35:33.214
Let's get--

35:33.297 --> 35:35.091
- Step aside.
- What is this?

35:35.174 --> 35:36.551
Jeez, what's going on?

35:37.218 --> 35:39.220
- A-reum, are you all right?
- They're scary.

35:39.303 --> 35:40.138
They look like thugs.

35:40.805 --> 35:44.350
All right!
Go back to your rooms and have some food!

35:44.433 --> 35:45.643
- Let's go upstairs.
- Step aside.

35:48.563 --> 35:50.398
Hey, who are those guys in suits?

35:50.481 --> 35:51.315
Kwon Man-su's people.

35:54.277 --> 35:57.196
Watching a fire is most entertaining,
but watching a fight comes in second.

35:57.321 --> 35:58.156
Let's go.

35:58.573 --> 36:00.241
No, I don't like it when people fight.

36:01.409 --> 36:03.870
A bloody storm awaits.

36:04.996 --> 36:08.583
Sir, there must've been
some misunderstanding.

36:08.666 --> 36:10.877
Let me explain.

36:11.627 --> 36:13.713
Please allow me to explain what happened!

36:15.756 --> 36:16.591
Gosh.

36:21.053 --> 36:22.763
Yes, what?

36:24.932 --> 36:27.143
- Check.
- Let's just say that I lost this round.

36:27.226 --> 36:28.394
I have a guest coming.

36:28.477 --> 36:30.563
I was going to win anyway.

36:30.688 --> 36:32.732
Issue me a pass to leave the hospital
as you promised.

36:42.158 --> 36:43.784
The crazy bitch who kidnapped that lunatic

36:43.868 --> 36:45.703
and brought him to my campaign rally,

36:46.120 --> 36:48.581
the caregiver who helped that bitch,

36:48.664 --> 36:52.084
and the hospital director who failed
to keep them under control

36:52.168 --> 36:55.046
and ruined my reputation should all
get down on their knees in front of me.

36:56.172 --> 36:57.006
Bring them to me now!

36:58.341 --> 36:59.926
Oh, the horse was here.

37:01.177 --> 37:02.845
HORSE

37:03.429 --> 37:04.680
Gang-tae!

37:07.058 --> 37:08.351
You're in deep trouble.

37:08.434 --> 37:09.727
You're fucking screwed.

37:11.312 --> 37:12.188
What do we do?

37:12.772 --> 37:14.482
Should I really call Ms. Ko?

37:14.565 --> 37:16.108
What if she refuses to come?

37:16.192 --> 37:17.485
She will, 100 percent.

37:17.568 --> 37:18.903
I'll call her.

37:20.071 --> 37:22.406
INSTRUCTOR CONTACTS

37:27.161 --> 37:27.995
Don't call her.

37:29.705 --> 37:30.706
Why not?

37:30.790 --> 37:32.291
I'll just go in there alone.

37:33.042 --> 37:34.460
Still, I should...

37:34.543 --> 37:36.963
Don't. Seriously, don't.

37:44.178 --> 37:46.138
What do we do?
Are we really not going to call her?

37:47.640 --> 37:50.101
He told us not to call her, Byeol.

37:51.102 --> 37:52.103
I'm sure he'll handle it.

37:54.939 --> 37:56.148
Why is she taking it out on me?

38:00.069 --> 38:01.279
"He told us not to call her."

38:05.616 --> 38:07.994
Thank you! Thank you so much.

38:08.744 --> 38:10.162
Thank you.

38:16.669 --> 38:17.545
My gosh.

38:19.255 --> 38:20.381
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

38:27.513 --> 38:30.224
See? I clearly warned you.

38:45.281 --> 38:46.198
Why did you come alone?

38:46.949 --> 38:48.367
Where's that bitch, your accomplice?

38:49.785 --> 38:52.621
She's not coming.
She doesn't need to be here.

38:53.205 --> 38:55.750
She's the culprit.
Who said she doesn't need to be here?

38:57.668 --> 38:59.628
Your son escaped the hospital
of his own accord.

39:00.004 --> 39:02.048
- No one took him there against his will.
- Hey.

39:02.548 --> 39:04.258
That idiot is not well.

39:04.759 --> 39:08.220
He strips off his clothes out of the blue
and pees regardless of where he is.

39:08.304 --> 39:11.974
And he spends tens of millions of won
in one night. He's insane!

39:12.058 --> 39:15.311
I locked him away here so that
he wouldn't be able to wander around.

39:16.187 --> 39:18.856
I can't believe you let him go
at my campaign rally of all places.

39:18.939 --> 39:21.609
I bet you people did it on purpose.

39:22.193 --> 39:23.861
Because I said
I'd shut this hospital down,

39:23.944 --> 39:26.197
you folks egged that idiot on

39:26.280 --> 39:28.240
to deliberately screw me over.

39:29.992 --> 39:32.620
It may have screwed you over,

39:32.703 --> 39:36.082
but your son's condition has improved
significantly thanks to that incident.

39:36.165 --> 39:37.917
He's well enough to be discharged soon.

39:38.000 --> 39:39.377
Are you out of your mind?

39:39.919 --> 39:42.463
Who's going to keep an eye
on that moron if you discharge him?

39:43.047 --> 39:45.007
It's kind of like how psychodrama works.

39:45.091 --> 39:48.677
If you release your pent-up emotions
while having the spotlight on you--

39:48.761 --> 39:49.595
Whatever.

39:51.806 --> 39:54.433
There are thousands of
psychiatric hospitals in the country.

39:55.518 --> 39:59.230
If I keep transferring him,
I can have him locked away forever!

39:59.730 --> 40:02.566
Gosh, you can't do that to your own son.

40:03.150 --> 40:06.112
I don't need a son
who is completely useless!

40:09.490 --> 40:12.243
He's useless?

40:13.536 --> 40:14.370
What?

40:18.249 --> 40:19.583
Do children

40:21.043 --> 40:23.129
have to be useful to their parents?

40:27.425 --> 40:28.259
Hey.

40:30.845 --> 40:31.720
We all

40:32.138 --> 40:34.515
came into this world
because our parents needed us.

40:36.392 --> 40:38.018
Go ask your parents.

40:39.019 --> 40:41.897
Whether or not they will need you

40:41.981 --> 40:43.899
if you're completely useless!

40:43.983 --> 40:46.110
Then you shouldn't have had him!

40:46.193 --> 40:47.445
You punk!

40:49.029 --> 40:50.823
You're a mere caregiver. How dare you!

40:51.866 --> 40:53.117
Jeez!

41:12.553 --> 41:15.014
SMILING CAN REALLY MAKE YOU HAPPY

41:33.574 --> 41:36.035
My gosh, you're adorable.

41:37.244 --> 41:38.454
Okay, here. Smile.

41:43.167 --> 41:46.128
How beautiful.

41:48.255 --> 41:50.424
A fountain!

41:52.301 --> 41:55.137
All right. One, two, three.

41:55.721 --> 41:58.849
Nice. Let's go.

42:05.356 --> 42:07.191
One, two, three.

42:14.365 --> 42:15.741
One, two, three.

42:19.411 --> 42:20.663
One,

42:21.539 --> 42:22.915
two, three.

42:33.926 --> 42:36.095
- Hey.
- Hello!

42:36.178 --> 42:37.471
Can you take a photo of me?

42:37.555 --> 42:38.556
Sure.

42:40.307 --> 42:43.185
What a beautiful day.
The weather is so nice today.

42:43.269 --> 42:46.021
Photos turn out great
when the weather is this nice. One...

42:46.105 --> 42:48.983
No! Go away, butterfly!

42:49.066 --> 42:50.818
A butterfly!

42:50.901 --> 42:53.445
Gosh, that was a butterfly!

42:53.529 --> 42:54.363
What's with him?

42:56.115 --> 42:57.866
Did he not like my pose?

43:06.208 --> 43:07.710
Goodness gracious. Can't you knock?

43:07.793 --> 43:10.629
I did. You're not going to let
Assemblyman Kwon do what he wants, right?

43:11.630 --> 43:12.464
I will.

43:13.048 --> 43:14.800
Sir, please.

43:15.467 --> 43:16.552
Come and have a look.

43:20.097 --> 43:21.015
Gosh.

43:43.162 --> 43:44.705
Then you shouldn't have had him!

43:45.039 --> 43:46.040
You punk!

43:47.541 --> 43:48.626
How dare you!

43:48.834 --> 43:49.918
You're a mere caregiver.

43:51.462 --> 43:52.838
I'm thinking of blackmailing him

43:53.547 --> 43:56.967
with this footage,
saying that I'll send this to the media.

43:57.051 --> 43:59.637
I'll also see if I can get him
to donate some money as well.

43:59.970 --> 44:01.388
Are you serious?

44:01.597 --> 44:03.015
Sure, why not?

44:03.098 --> 44:06.101
As for Kwon Gi-do,
I'm sure the kidnapping incident

44:06.185 --> 44:08.854
will actually help him get better.

44:09.188 --> 44:10.314
Then all I need to do

44:11.315 --> 44:14.693
is punish the jerk
who slapped our caregiver.

44:17.946 --> 44:20.199
I've done nothing
to get on your wrong side, right?

44:25.329 --> 44:27.873
The sky over on this side.
The sky is up here.

44:27.956 --> 44:30.459
And the waves. The sea.

44:30.542 --> 44:33.253
The sea should be here. Hello!

44:33.837 --> 44:37.549
Then... The hospital should be
in the middle. After that, the sea...

44:37.633 --> 44:38.676
The sea...

44:39.259 --> 44:41.470
The swing. The swing is under it.

44:41.553 --> 44:44.223
What is this? Is it something
only good people can see?

44:44.306 --> 44:45.849
It's the sea.

44:55.984 --> 44:57.027
Finally, we meet.

44:57.861 --> 44:59.196
My dear Sang-tae.

45:03.700 --> 45:05.577
Oh, my. What should I do?

45:06.161 --> 45:07.246
Hello.

45:08.330 --> 45:09.331
My gosh.

45:10.707 --> 45:11.583
Go on in first.

45:12.876 --> 45:13.877
Sang-tae!

45:14.420 --> 45:16.255
- Look at the camera.
- One.

45:17.256 --> 45:19.758
Look up here. One, two, three.

45:23.554 --> 45:26.932
My gosh! There, it's done.

45:32.062 --> 45:34.440
Are you here
because you got a call from us?

45:34.523 --> 45:36.358
What? You told me to pretend
not to know you.

45:38.026 --> 45:39.611
What call?

45:40.696 --> 45:43.365
Well, I was just wondering
because you don't have class today.

45:44.950 --> 45:48.078
I'm here to take Ko Dae-hwan
out for a walk.

45:50.038 --> 45:52.875
Someone got fuming mad at me
for not keeping my promise,

45:53.500 --> 45:56.128
so I came here to cool him off.

45:56.670 --> 45:58.630
Now, I'm just doing a service for a fan.

45:59.214 --> 46:00.924
Yes, "service."
I know what "service" means.

46:01.008 --> 46:03.385
You get a free caricature
when you order a full-size pizza.

46:04.678 --> 46:07.431
Gosh, what's he saying?
This guy is so funny.

46:07.514 --> 46:09.099
Girls like funny guys.

46:10.017 --> 46:12.478
My gosh, I'm with writer Ko Mun-yeong.

46:30.370 --> 46:31.330
Where are you, Sang-tae?

46:34.082 --> 46:36.543
This is pretty. I like it.

46:44.551 --> 46:45.761
It's 10,000 won.

46:47.012 --> 46:48.138
You said earlier that it's free.

46:48.722 --> 46:51.266
Did you order pizza?
You didn't have any pizza.

46:53.268 --> 46:57.231
My gosh, what do I do with you?
You're so cute.

46:57.481 --> 46:58.690
You have a dinosaur.

46:58.774 --> 47:01.693
Come on.
TWICE is much cuter. Let's be real.

47:01.777 --> 47:02.903
Don't touch his hair.

47:06.323 --> 47:07.366
Are you still mad at me?

47:08.659 --> 47:10.494
Look. I'm here
to take my father out for a walk.

47:10.869 --> 47:12.704
You're mad
because I didn't keep my word, right?

47:15.082 --> 47:17.709
Sang-tae, can you go wait in the lobby?

47:17.793 --> 47:21.088
No, I don't want to.
I'm going to stay here with Ms. Ko.

47:21.171 --> 47:23.340
- I'll stay here with Ms. Ko--
- Do as I say, please!

47:30.556 --> 47:31.473
Just wait in the lobby.

47:32.933 --> 47:33.976
I'll be right there.

47:36.562 --> 47:38.897
- Sang-tae.
- Hey, did someone slap you?

47:44.736 --> 47:46.029
Who slapped you in the face?

47:46.863 --> 47:47.906
What happened to your face?

47:50.075 --> 47:52.411
Who's the jerk that did this to you?
Who hit you?

47:52.494 --> 47:53.996
I'll teach them a lesson. Tell me who.

47:56.039 --> 47:57.457
I bet you just put up with it again.

47:57.541 --> 47:59.710
You got hit and just put up with it
like a loser, right?

48:02.754 --> 48:04.006
I asked you who did this to you.

48:05.007 --> 48:06.174
Why are you getting angry?

48:06.758 --> 48:07.759
What?

48:08.468 --> 48:09.761
Why are you getting so worked up?

48:09.845 --> 48:11.013
Because someone slapped you.

48:11.680 --> 48:12.514
So what?

48:14.558 --> 48:15.601
Does that break your heart?

48:18.729 --> 48:21.148
Or does it make you sad?

48:26.278 --> 48:28.113
What exactly are you feeling right now?

48:31.450 --> 48:32.284
You

48:33.327 --> 48:34.161
don't know

48:35.954 --> 48:38.457
what kind of emotion is getting you
so worked up.

48:40.417 --> 48:41.376
Even you have no clue.

48:43.879 --> 48:45.464
You're all empty inside.

48:46.173 --> 48:47.549
You're just loud.

48:49.259 --> 48:50.719
Like an empty can.

48:53.639 --> 48:54.723
So you'd better not

48:55.641 --> 48:57.976
act like you know and understand
everything about me

48:58.060 --> 48:59.353
when you know nothing.

49:01.480 --> 49:02.689
Don't be delusional.

49:05.776 --> 49:08.612
You won't understand me

49:11.490 --> 49:12.407
until the day you die.

49:47.859 --> 49:48.985
KANG SUN-DEOK

49:52.406 --> 49:53.240
Hello?

49:54.658 --> 49:57.285
Gosh, I don't want to. Why not?

49:57.369 --> 49:58.912
Don't... Oh, no.

50:01.790 --> 50:04.292
Your expression shows your emotions

50:04.376 --> 50:06.044
Do as I say, please!

50:06.962 --> 50:08.588
Annoyed.

50:08.672 --> 50:10.674
He's annoyed.

50:12.050 --> 50:13.093
He...

50:15.721 --> 50:16.722
hates his brother.

50:17.931 --> 50:22.269
He hates me. No, no. Gosh, what do I do?

50:22.853 --> 50:23.687
Why...

50:26.565 --> 50:27.607
Oh, it's a bunny.

50:29.151 --> 50:31.737
Come out.
If you come out, I'll give you this.

50:34.239 --> 50:37.200
Come on. I'll also make a turtle
with a radish for you.

50:40.495 --> 50:41.538
Gosh.

50:44.124 --> 50:46.668
Gang-tae is waiting for you outside.

50:46.752 --> 50:48.712
Are you going to stay here
by yourself all night?

50:48.795 --> 50:51.923
You need to come out
so that I can tidy up quickly and go home.

50:53.800 --> 50:55.385
Sang-tae.

50:59.848 --> 51:01.725
Come on. Let's go home. Come out.

51:01.808 --> 51:03.810
- Gosh, this way. Goodness.
- No, I don't want to go.

51:03.894 --> 51:06.062
Come out. My goodness!

51:07.147 --> 51:09.941
Oh, no. My back...

51:11.443 --> 51:13.445
No, not this.

51:16.281 --> 51:18.074
Gosh, my back.

51:22.370 --> 51:25.457
- Where's Sang-tae?
- I'll bring him home later.

51:25.540 --> 51:27.709
Don't worry about him
and just get going. Here.

51:30.504 --> 51:32.422
I'm sorry to make you do this.

51:32.506 --> 51:33.924
Why are you sorry? Don't be.

51:34.508 --> 51:35.550
Go on.

51:36.927 --> 51:37.928
Gang-tae.

51:39.179 --> 51:40.472
Don't eat dinner and wait for me.

51:40.555 --> 51:43.433
I'll make delicious beef stir-fry
when I get home.

52:26.726 --> 52:29.563
I'll tag along the first few times
just in case anything happens.

52:38.530 --> 52:40.824
Are you sure
all your memories got wiped out?

52:42.659 --> 52:44.244
You're not just pretending?

52:45.120 --> 52:46.580
Stop provoking him.

53:02.888 --> 53:04.014
Did you

53:05.140 --> 53:08.351
really forget what kind of person I am?

53:10.312 --> 53:11.271
Dad.

53:22.949 --> 53:23.909
You...

53:24.784 --> 53:25.952
Why...

53:27.579 --> 53:28.788
are you

53:30.540 --> 53:32.167
still alive?

53:46.723 --> 53:47.974
Die.

53:50.018 --> 53:52.395
Die, you...

53:52.479 --> 53:53.480
Go quickly.

53:53.563 --> 53:55.899
You monster!

53:55.982 --> 54:00.654
- Stop, Mr. Ko!
- Die, you... You monster.

54:02.530 --> 54:03.865
Over here, help!

54:03.949 --> 54:06.993
Die, you... You monster.

54:07.077 --> 54:08.453
Calm him down.

54:09.079 --> 54:11.122
You're a monster.

54:59.838 --> 55:03.466
It serves you right.
You shouldn't have come here.

55:15.395 --> 55:17.188
Ms. Ko, The Little Mermaid
from last class...

55:18.815 --> 55:19.816
She ignored me.

55:20.400 --> 55:21.568
I think she hates me.

55:22.110 --> 55:23.236
No, she doesn't.

55:23.653 --> 55:26.614
"If you talk to me, I'll kill you."
It's written on her forehead.

55:27.615 --> 55:28.992
I didn't see that.

55:29.576 --> 55:31.870
Oh, your medication must be wearing off.

55:32.370 --> 55:33.830
Come on. You should take your pills.

57:00.375 --> 57:03.586
So you'd better not act like you know
and understand everything about me

57:03.670 --> 57:05.004
when you know nothing.

57:05.088 --> 57:06.464
Don't be delusional.

57:07.257 --> 57:10.468
You won't understand me
until the day you die.

58:08.026 --> 58:11.613
You don't know what kind of emotion
is getting you so worked up.

58:12.238 --> 58:13.364
Even you have no clue.

58:13.448 --> 58:15.074
You're all empty inside.

58:15.658 --> 58:16.910
You're just loud.

58:18.703 --> 58:19.662
Like an empty can.

58:21.664 --> 58:23.416
You also won't be able to understand me

58:24.751 --> 58:26.085
until the day you die.

59:00.954 --> 59:02.413
ZOMBIE KID

59:16.469 --> 59:19.973
"A baby boy was born in a small village.

59:21.683 --> 59:23.017
He had pale skin

59:23.977 --> 59:26.062
and large eyes.

59:27.313 --> 59:28.815
While raising the boy,

59:29.148 --> 59:31.276
his mother
naturally came to the realization

59:34.028 --> 59:37.657
that he had no feelings whatsoever.

59:38.783 --> 59:41.619
All he had was the desire to eat,
like a zombie.

59:47.667 --> 59:51.004
So his mother locked him up
in the basement

59:51.546 --> 59:53.464
so that the villagers wouldn't see him.

59:54.132 --> 59:56.259
And every night, she stole livestock
from her neighbors to feed him.

59:57.093 --> 59:59.095
That's how she raised him in secret.

01:00:01.055 --> 01:00:02.348
One night, she'd steal a chicken.

01:00:03.141 --> 01:00:04.559
The next day, she'd steal a pig.

01:00:06.436 --> 01:00:08.187
A number of years passed like that.

01:00:09.147 --> 01:00:12.817
Then one day, an epidemic broke out.
It left the remaining animals dead,

01:00:14.360 --> 01:00:15.820
and it also killed many people.

01:00:17.947 --> 01:00:19.365
Those who survived the epidemic

01:00:20.491 --> 01:00:22.035
left the village.

01:00:24.495 --> 01:00:26.497
But the mother
couldn't leave her son all alone.

01:00:27.498 --> 01:00:29.292
And to appease her son crying of hunger,

01:00:30.251 --> 01:00:32.420
she cut off one leg of hers
and gave it to him.

01:00:33.379 --> 01:00:35.298
After that, it was her arm.

01:00:36.299 --> 01:00:37.800
She gave him all her limbs.

01:00:38.092 --> 01:00:40.219
When she was left
with nothing but her torso,

01:00:40.970 --> 01:00:43.389
she embraced her son for the last time

01:00:43.473 --> 01:00:46.059
- to let him devour what was left of her."
- Come here.

01:00:46.392 --> 01:00:48.353
- It's cold.
- Gosh, it's raining. Come here.

01:00:48.436 --> 01:00:50.063
- Here, come here.
- Mom, wait.

01:00:50.146 --> 01:00:51.731
HARIMGAK

01:00:51.814 --> 01:00:53.107
Come here, Gang-tae.

01:00:53.775 --> 01:00:54.734
Gang-tae, come on.

01:01:52.625 --> 01:01:54.669
"With his both arms,

01:01:55.336 --> 01:01:58.339
the boy tightly held his mother's torso

01:01:59.757 --> 01:02:01.676
and spoke for the first time in his life.

01:02:04.512 --> 01:02:05.972
- 'Mom.
- "Mom.

01:02:07.849 --> 01:02:09.475
- You're...
- You're...

01:02:10.893 --> 01:02:12.228
so warm.'"

01:02:12.437 --> 01:02:13.521
so warm."

01:02:53.311 --> 01:02:54.979
You're different from others.

01:02:55.563 --> 01:02:56.773
You're extremely special.

01:02:58.983 --> 01:03:01.569
You're my greatest creation.

01:03:02.570 --> 01:03:06.783
Why are you still alive?

01:03:10.161 --> 01:03:11.370
What did the boy really want?

01:03:12.705 --> 01:03:13.998
Satiating his hunger?

01:03:15.500 --> 01:03:17.877
Or feeling his mother's warmth?

01:04:10.805 --> 01:04:13.099
Oh, boy. Hey, it's pouring outside.

01:04:21.065 --> 01:04:22.275
Hey, are you all right?

01:04:24.235 --> 01:04:25.820
Ju-ri called.

01:04:26.320 --> 01:04:27.572
She asked me to check in on you.

01:04:31.242 --> 01:04:32.660
I heard you got slapped again.

01:04:33.369 --> 01:04:36.163
Enough, seriously.
Things like this really upset me.

01:04:38.332 --> 01:04:39.917
Are you doing this on purpose or what?

01:04:44.171 --> 01:04:48.551
By the way, I heard Ko Mun-yeong's father
choked her and caused a huge scene.

01:04:49.176 --> 01:04:50.177
What?

01:04:51.137 --> 01:04:52.847
When? Who said that?

01:04:52.930 --> 01:04:56.017
I overheard some patients talking about it
when I went there to deliver an order.

01:04:57.727 --> 01:04:59.228
It sounded like a lot of people saw it.

01:05:02.023 --> 01:05:04.984
He must hate his daughter so much
for him to choke her like that.

01:05:05.276 --> 01:05:06.736
Her father is obviously not sane.

01:05:06.819 --> 01:05:08.321
- Jae-su.
- Yes?

01:05:09.322 --> 01:05:12.158
- I need to borrow your motorcycle.
- Hey, what? It's raining now.

01:05:12.241 --> 01:05:14.869
Hey, Gang-tae! Wait!

01:05:16.662 --> 01:05:17.496
Oh, boy.

01:05:18.331 --> 01:05:20.082
Why is he being like that?

01:08:28.687 --> 01:08:31.440
SPECIAL THANKS TO KWAK DONG-YEON
FOR MAKING A GUEST APPEARANCE

01:09:06.308 --> 01:09:08.894
Do you like me?

01:09:09.562 --> 01:09:10.396
Damn it.

01:09:10.479 --> 01:09:12.273
You must've been
a servant in your past life.

01:09:13.107 --> 01:09:14.275
And I must've been a mistress.

01:09:14.692 --> 01:09:15.526
Get out!

01:09:15.609 --> 01:09:17.778
- Why do you keep siding with her?
- Let go.

01:09:18.696 --> 01:09:19.613
You don't own me.

01:09:21.031 --> 01:09:22.032
I want to forget.

01:09:22.616 --> 01:09:23.993
She saved my life,

01:09:24.618 --> 01:09:25.870
but I ran.

01:09:25.953 --> 01:09:28.414
I hung out with him because I was bored.

01:09:30.207 --> 01:09:32.877
Do you want to come pick him up?
We're at the cursed castle.
